msgid "placeholder_help_text"
msgstr "<h3>Placeholders</h3>"
"<p>You can use the field names (&quot;Identifier&quot;) of form elements as placeholders in texts.<br>"
"Placeholders dynamically show the content of the fields filled in by users:<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><pre>$firstname</pre>This placeholder uses the content of the form field with the name `firstname`.<br>"
"If the user enters 'Jane' in the field, 'Jane' will appear in place of the placeholder in the text.</li>"
"<li><pre>{{$firstname|Customer}}</pre>This format shows the content of the field `firstname`.<br>"
"If the field is empty, the alternative text 'Customer' will be displayed instead.</li>"
"<li><pre>{{Hello $firstname $lastname|Dear Sir or Madam}}</pre>This format combines multiple placeholders.<br>"
"If both `firstname` and `lastname` are filled in, 'Hello Jane Doe' will be displayed.<br>"
"If at least one of the fields is empty, the alternative text 'Dear Sir or Madam' will be displayed.</li>"
"</ul>"
